+| Theme contract documentation                                     | `resources/css/kiosk/themes/_base.css`                                                   | ✓      |
+| Default theme (no-op)                                            | `resources/css/kiosk/themes/standard.css`                                                | ✓      |
+| Halloween theme (orange / violet)                                | `resources/css/kiosk/themes/halloween.css`                                               | ✓      |
